The upstream integration's behavior is split across four downstream runtime
files, each carrying a prominent derivation and modification notice. The fork
adds native Pi prompt lifecycle handling, counted async-work leases through
`herdr:busy`, reliable acknowledgement-aware delivery, and periodic state
heartbeat recovery.

Herdr and Pi are independent projects. This community fork is not affiliated
